  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TO6 Kenya: InBusiness - Disability Inclusive Business: Linking micro and small business owned by PWD to established commercial enterprises</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sense International will engage: 12 micro-entrepreneurs with deafblindness (and their family members) trained, 1 Business Development Service providers (BDS) are deployed, and 1 Lead Business Mentors (LBM) connected to the micro-enterprises. 
-	Mapping and identification of people with deafblindness and their families.
-	Linkage meetings with BDS providers and people with deafblindness and their families.
-	Training of people with deafblindness and their families and/or support assistants on business development.
-	Development of individualized business support plans</narrative>
  </description>
